        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10303 = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Why save me?" The revived Knight's bulging eyes threaten to escape his ghostly face. "I wanted to die with my soul intact - before the madness took me!" 
Against all healing, he returned to the shadows. The Knight steps back into the darkness, his body barely pieced together by the Healer Priest's tireless care. Who now needs his sword?]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10303"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10304 = {
          ContentEN = "\"If that stubborn shopkeeper refuses to change his ways, allow me to provide some special customer care.\" The Illusionist scattered a deck of cards across the table, backs up. \"Go ahead—take your pick, as many as you like!\"",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10304"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10305 = {
          ContentEN = "He'd rather be known as \"the Illusionist\" than \"that freak\". In this bleak, monotonous void, conjuring joy is his only pursuit—the cost of that joy matters little, for he has nothing left to lose.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10305"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10306 = {
          ContentEN = "Wealth is best in abundance—yet mere accumulation is simply dull. Let riches take nobler forms, let the masses sing praises of my generosity! Accept this gift… and add another verse to my legend.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10306"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10307 = {
          ContentEN = "True knowledge demands a feast of pages—taste every text, or remain starved of understanding.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10307"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10308 = {
          ContentEN = "Truth thrives in simplicity—profound contemplation and careful deliberation can yield invaluable insights even from limited knowledge.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10308"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10309 = {
          ContentEN = "Endless darkness threatens to consume you whole, yet miraculously, a feeble flame flickers back to life from the embers. If the abyss truly has a will… perhaps even it refuses to let your story end here.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10309"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10310 = {
          ContentEN = [[
A knight with a silver blade cut through the enemy ranks, his radiance spilling across the battlefield like a rising full moon. The exhausted soldiers stirred once more beneath its glow.
 Ah... the guidance of the Goddess of Fate! Moved by the miracle, the people wept with joy. Faith rekindled strength in weary limbs, and so they rose, following the light into the fray.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10310"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10311 = {
          ContentEN = "When darkness first defiled the sacred lake, Elysium's bravest knights stepped forth.\n Most never returned. Those who survived lost their dreams forever — the instant their eyes closed, the Abyss reclaimed them, dragging their minds into darkness.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10311"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10312 = {
          ContentEN = "On the eve of battle, a young knight, brimming with vigour and resolve, donned silver armour to hide the holy markings unfurling like wings across his back. One final victory for Elysium — that was all he asked, before answering the call.\n But the triumph proved hollow. A colossal Filthoid tore through Elysium's lines, and the knight vanished without a trace. Some say wings carried him skyward, forsaking his homeland. Others believe the Dark Moon claimed his mind, and he became one with the beast.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10312"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10313 = {
          ContentEN = "Her toes brushed the surface of the sacred lake, sending ripples across the water — lightless and still — as though a dark moon were surfacing from the depths. If this lake truly led to the realm of all happiness, why did it not even offer a reflection?\n In an instant, a fierce current arose, and the saint's doubts, along with their very self — were swallowed by the pitch-black whirlpool.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10313"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10314 = {
          ContentEN = "The noblewoman claimed divine blood coursed through her veins — that she was born to sacrifice herself, to save her people.\n On the day of coronation, she set her long hair alight, transforming the sacred rite into a blazing execution. The temple — and all nobles within — turned to ash. The flames roared heavenward, brighter than the sun. Those toiling below paused in awe to witness the light.\n She burned. She gave. She saved.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10314"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10315 = {
          ContentEN = "I lived through the age of darkness — when heretics rose as one to bring the Tower to ruin.\n I saw it then: thousands of thorns cascading from its heights, veiling the heavens in thorned shadow. Be not afraid, O faithful. The gods punish only the guilty. When the thorns have strangled every sin, a new age shall rise — blood-drenched, yet radiant with promised grace.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10315"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_10316 = {
          ContentEN = "She saw the darkness creeping in. But the path was already lost — how could she bear to take anything more from them?\n So she offered a glimmering candy — a fleeting dream, perhaps a lie — anything that might bring a smile to her friend's face.\n If it did, even once, that was enough.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_10316"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_11101 = {
          ContentEN = [[
At nineteen, war claimed him the moment the claws of a Filthoid tore through a fellow teammate he just met before his shield could rise, leaving a crimson bloom and a faint scratch no scrubbing could erase. 
So what is he still fighting for? For faith, for justice, or just to outrun the past.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_11101"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_11201 = {
          ContentEN = "Fourteen and on his first training day, he selected this sword from the merchant's pile of beginner gear— old-fashioned, his friends teased. \"Guns are way more practical!\" \n\"Knights don't carry pistols,\" he retorted, hoisting the blade overhead like in the storybooks. \"For Elysium!\"",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_11201"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_12101 = {
          ContentEN = "Seek not flawless paths, for wisdom walks between. Strike when the hour is right, or lose what might have been.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_12101"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_12102 = {
          ContentEN = "Foolish is he who covets material things, for desire breeds corruption. Let him who would reap first count the cost of sowing.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_12102"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_12201 = {
          ContentEN = "Steadfast patience is the highest virtue. Wait as the grass for morning dew, for divine grace shall descend as spring rain. Cast away worldly cares, and walk the radiant path with devout heart.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_12201"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_13101 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Not gentle glow, nor crackling campfire. 
Like a raging inferno, I will burn through all that stands in my way.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_13101"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_13102 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Not spring's gentle rain, nor babbling brook. 
I am the tsunami that drowns cities, leaving no obstacle standing.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_13102"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_13103 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Not a gentle breeze, nor a whispering wind. 
I shall be the howling gale that tears roofs asunder, tearing through all barriers.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_13103"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_13104 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Not a flicker of light, nor spark in the dark. 
I am the silent thunder splitting the night, striking terror into all who stand before me.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_13104"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_14101 = {
          ContentEN = "Since childhood, she idolized her sister—the brilliant Knight who could conquer any challenge. \nWhile legends warned that none return alive from the abyss beneath the sacred lake, her sister proved them wrong. \nShe lived… in terrible silence.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_14101"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_14201 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Grown-ups whisper that my sister offended the gods in the sacred lake, so they took a piece of her soul as punishment. 
No, my sister is a true Knight, devout and honorable. Her soul was lost there by accident. If no one else will believe, I'll make them see. 
The abyss awaits, but I will return with the piece missing.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_14201"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_14202 = {
          ContentEN = "Sister… is that you? What happened to you? Why are you pointing your sword at me? \n\"Liar... liar...\" The dark shadow repeats in a shrill, piercing voice, \"There's no justice, only lies.\" \nIt's all coming back to her—her sister's whispered wish to quit the order and live a simple life.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_14202"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_14301 = {
          ContentEN = "The shadow fades as if it never was. At last she sees—her sister's missing piece is gone forever. \nDid my worship become your curse? If I hadn't been so overjoyed when you were chosen, would you still be here? Was it me who ended your life? \nHer sorrowful cries echo in the silent abyss.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_14301"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_15101 = {
          ContentEN = "Why does she drag her battered body through this endless maze, pressing on despite knowing it's all for nothing?\n Because no matter where she hides, Kathy always finds her. Because no matter how absurd the excuse, Flynn never gets angry. Because she still grips that bloodstained badge — heavy with the weight of someone's unshakable trust.\n Because now... she carries something she cannot walk away from.",
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_15101"
        },
        RLTreasure_IPDesc_15201 = {
          ContentEN = [[
All her life, she's chosen the path of a quitter. She skipped the Sacred Tree Academy's selection, and after joining the knight order, never once sought promotion.
 No one climbs forever. Better to stay where she first stood, than chase a summit she was bound to fall from.]],
          TextMapId = "RLTreasure_IPDesc_15201"
        },
