          ContentEN = [[
Enters [Stealth] state and exits [Relentless Hunt] state. 
Generates 2 [Fang Spikes] to attack nearby enemies when exiting [Stealth] state or using [Stealthy Prowl] again in [Stealth] state.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510201_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_510201_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Stealthy Prowl",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510201_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_510202_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
Retracts all [Fang Spikes] and enters [Relentless Hunt] state.
For each [Fang Spike] retracted, Outsider loses certain HP, which is converted into an equivalent amount of Ultra Shield, and it additionally extends the duration of [Relentless Hunt] state.
When losing HP due to this effect, the minimum HP will not drop below 1.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510202_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_510202_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Predator's Pounce",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510202_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_510203_DESC = {
          ContentEN = "When taking damage, Outsider generates 1 [Fang Spike] to attack the damage dealer. This effect can only be triggered once per second.",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510203_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_510203_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Fang for Fang",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510203_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_510204_DESC = {
          ContentEN = "When not in [Relentless Hunt] state, there is a chance to generate 1 [Fang Spike] to attack the target while dealing damage with a melee weapon. This effect can only be triggered once per second.",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510204_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_510204_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Ravenous Gnaw",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_510204_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_530101_DESC = {
          ContentEN = "Creates 1 [Phantasm] and then flashes forward. This skill can be used at any time without interrupting Psyche's current action. In [Flamboyance] state, this skill is replaced with [Phototaxis].",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530101_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_530101_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Chrysalis Dreamweave",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530101_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_530102_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
Enters [Flamboyance] state and gains the ability to fly.
When in [Flamboyance] state, Psyche can only use skills and shoot. [Flamboyance] state continuously consumes Sanity, and when Sanity drops to 0 or this skill is used again, [Flamboyance] state ends.

When Psyche's HP percentage is above 15%, [Flamboyance] state consumes HP insteand of Sanity. The consumed HP will be converted into Ultra Shield at a certain percentage.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530102_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_530102_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Fluorescent Eclosion",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530102_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_530103_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
When dealing CRIT damage, Psyche gains one of the following buffs at random: ATK Boost, Skill Intensity Boost, or Resolve Boost.
Increases Psyche's damage for each buff she gains, up to 12 buffs.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530103_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_530103_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Amberlight",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530103_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_530104_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
When using [Fluorescent Eclosion], if Psyche's HP percentage is no less than 75%, gains [Ephemeral as Dew].
[Ephemeral as Dew]: When triggering the effect of Morale/Resolve, it regards Psyche's HP percentage as 1%. This effect can only be triggered once every 120s.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530104_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_530104_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Ephemeral as Dew",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_530104_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_540101_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
Grants [Emerald Effusion]. While active, alchemical smoke fills the area around the user, continuously healing self and allies while slowing enemies in the area. 
While [Emerald Effusion] is active, generates 2 [Azoth Projectiles] per second.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540101_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_540101_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Emerald Effusion",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540101_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_540102_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
Heals self and allies, applying [Purification Formula]. Briefly restrains nearby enemies and inflicts [Decay Formula] on them. 
Generates 1 [Azoth Projectile] per affected target (ally or enemy), up to a maximum of 12.]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540102_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_540102_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Repulsion Synthesis",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540102_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_540103_DESC = {
          ContentEN = [[
Increases Daphne's Ranged Weapon Trigger Probability when she possesses [Azoth Projectile].
Daphne can hold up to 30 [Azoth Projectiles], and each ranged weapon attack consumes 1 [Azoth Projectile].]],
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540103_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_540103_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Azoth Projectile",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540103_NAME"
        },
        SKILL_540104_DESC = {
          ContentEN = "When Daphne possesses [Azoth Projectile] and her ranged weapon attack deals damage, target hit by the ranged weapon attack incurs the DoT of [Decay Formula] 1 time. The damage is based on a certain percentage of Daphne's Ranged Weapon Trigger Probability.",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540104_DESC"
        },
        SKILL_540104_NAME = {
          ContentEN = "Argent Lacrima",
          TextMapId = "SKILL_540104_NAME"
        },
