          ContentEN = "Once the Gritblight is fully cleared, the activated Zhuyin Scale will attract Filthoids. Meanwhile, more Gritblight will reappear nearby and gradually condense.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_LongLin_3"
        },
        UIGuide_LongLin_4 = {
          ContentEN = "Defeat all Filthoids before the Gritblight fully condenses to harvest the Zhuyin Scale successfully.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_LongLin_4"
        },
        UIGuide_LongPressedSkills = {
          ContentEN = "Some skills trigger different effects based on whether they are <H>held</> or <H>pressed</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_LongPressedSkills"
        },
        UIGuide_MiShi_1 = {
          ContentEN = "A fixed number of <Highlight>Jishu Chambers</> are placed throughout the arena. Each chamber is marked with a number, but the same number may appear on more than one chamber.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_MiShi_1"
        },
        UIGuide_MiShi_2 = {
          ContentEN = [[
<Highlight>Jishu Chambers</> can be opened with a <Highlight>Jishu Key</> bearing the matching number. Inside, you may find containers holding high-value relics, but there is also a chance of triggering toxic gas. Stay alert and avoid it.
Jishu Keys can be found in specific containers during the match. Each key can only be used once. Participating in Defence Tasks greatly increases the chance of finding them. If a key is brought out of the arena, it will be converted into 100 Civil Tokens. This conversion is not affected by incense effects.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_MiShi_2"
        },
        UIGuide_MirrorPuzzle_1 = {
          ContentEN = "This measuring device was placed here by Lunoxplorer. Once activated, it gathers the data she seeks. Rotate it into position and activate it to claim the rewards she left for kind-hearted travellers.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_MirrorPuzzle_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ModTendency_1 = {
          ContentEN = "The top of a Demon Wedge slot shows its <H>Track</> (if any).",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ModTendency_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ModTendency_2 = {
          ContentEN = "The upper left corner of a <H>Demon Wedge</> shows its <H>Track</> (if any).",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ModTendency_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ModTendency_3 = {
          ContentEN = "Equipping any Demon Wedge in a <H>neutral</> slot <H>does not change</> the required Tolerance. Equipping a <H>neutral</> Demon Wedge in any slot <H>does not change</> the required Tolerance.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ModTendency_3"
        },
        UIGuide_ModTendency_4 = {
          ContentEN = "When equipping a Demon Wedge in a slot with the <H>same Track</>, the required Tolerance will be <H>lowered</> due to a kind of synergy between the Demon Wedge and the bearer.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ModTendency_4"
        },
        UIGuide_ModTendency_5 = {
          ContentEN = "When equipping a Demon Wedge in a slot with <H>different Tracks</>, the required Tolerance will be <H>increased</> due to a kind of mutual rejection between the Demon Wedge and the bearer.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ModTendency_5"
        },
        UIGuide_MonsterExitMechanism_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Enemy units periodically spawn from within this passage. The passage can only be sealed by <H>attacking specific weak points with the correct approach</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_MonsterExitMechanism_1"
        },
        UIGuide_MonsterExitMechanism_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Enemy units periodically spawn from within this passage. You can either <H>interact with certain devices</> or <H>defeat all the enemies</> to seal the passage.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_MonsterExitMechanism_2"
        },
        UIGuide_NiuDan_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Martial Tokens can be used at the Incense Selector within the arena to exchange for incense that grants various buffs. Only one incense effect can be active per match. Spend additional Martial Tokens to reactivate the device and refresh the selection of available incense.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_NiuDan_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_01_01 = {
          ContentEN = "When doing a private commission alone or with friends, other players <H>cannot</> join halfway.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_01_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_01_02 = {
          ContentEN = "When doing a public commission alone or with friends, other players <H>can</> join halfway.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_01_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_02_01 = {
          ContentEN = "In solo mode, a private commission will start immediately once you select it.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_02_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_02_02 = {
          ContentEN = "In co-op mode, a private commission will require all members to <H>confirm within 10 seconds</>. Once everyone confirms or the timer runs out, the commission begins.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_02_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_03_01 = {
          ContentEN = "In solo mode for public commissions, the system will search for an ongoing commission for <H>10 seconds</> for you to join halfway. If no match is found, you will start the commission from the beginning. The search can be cancelled anytime during the 10-second window.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_03_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_03_02 = {
          ContentEN = "In co-op mode for public commissions, the system will search for an ongoing commission for <H>10 seconds</> for your team to join halfway; if one is found, it will start after <H>all team members have confirmed</>. If no match is found, your team will start the commission from the beginning. The search can be cancelled anytime by anyone on the team during the 10-second window.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_03_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_04_01 = {
          ContentEN = "Whether in solo or co-op mode, the objectives of commissions remain the same. But the <H>difficulty</> <H>increases</> with the number of players. The larger the team, the more enemies will spawn, and the higher their levels will be.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_04_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_04_02 = {
          ContentEN = "At the end of each round in any Commission ∞, a vote is held. Players who vote to continue will proceed to the next round, while those who choose to retreat will exit. Each player's choice <H>doesn't affect that of the others</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_04_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_04_03 = {
          ContentEN = "Once any team member reaches the Evacuation Point, a <H>30-second</> countdown will begin. The commission will automatically finalise when the timer expires, or if all team members reach the Evacuation Point during the countdown, the commission will finalise immediately.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_04_03"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_05_01 = {
          ContentEN = "Each team member has a limited number of revival chances. When defeated, a 20-second timer will begin. If you don't select \"revive\" before the timer runs out, the commission will fail.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_05_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_05_02 = {
          ContentEN = "When a team member chooses to revive during a co-op commission, other players can assist by approaching them, speeding up the revival process.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_05_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Online_06_01 = {
          ContentEN = "Teams formed prior to starting a public commission will remain intact after the commission ends, while players who joined halfway will leave the team after completion.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Online_06_01"
        },
        UIGuide_OverloadShield = {
          ContentEN = [[
A character's bonus shield gained through certain means. Ultra Shield will be <H>consumed first</> when taking damage.
The cap of Ultra Shield increases as the <H>Character Level</> rises.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_OverloadShield"
        },
        UIGuide_PerfectDodge = {
          ContentEN = "When facing strong enemies In Chapter Twilight, <H>dodging</> at the last moment before an attack hit will <H>slow</> nearby enemies for a brief period.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_PerfectDodge"
        },
        UIGuide_PetPan_01 = {
          ContentEN = "The cleverest of all Geniemons — their traces can be found all over, if you look closely.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_PetPan_01"
        },
        UIGuide_PetPan_02 = {
          ContentEN = "Follow them, and you just might stumble upon something delightful.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_PetPan_02"
        },
        UIGuide_PetPan_Title = {
          ContentEN = "Go track down the Paniemon!",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_PetPan_Title"
        },
        UIGuide_Pet_1 = {
          ContentEN = "<H>Geniemons</> is now available. You may encounter <H>Geniemons</> from various locations across the world now. They can provide a variety of assists in battle.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Pet_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Pet_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Use high-quality Treats and time your feeding attempts wisely to greatly increase your chances of befriending a Geniemon.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Pet_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_1_1 = {
          ContentEN = "During <H>world exploration</> or a <H>Solo Commission</>, you can summon up to <H>2</> Combat Partners at the same time.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_1_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_1_2 = {
          ContentEN = "During a <H>2-player Commission</>, each player can only summon <H>1</> Combat Partner.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_1_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_1_3 = {
          ContentEN = "During a <H>Commission with 3 or more players</>, <H>no Combat Partners can be summoned</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_1_3"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_2_1 = {
          ContentEN = "While exploring the <H>world</>, you can use <H>[Sigil: Void]</> to <H>dismiss</> your Combat Partner(s) at any time.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_2_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_2_2 = {
          ContentEN = "During <h>Commissions</> or when challenging <H>Nocturnal Echoes</>, you <H>cannot dismiss</> your Combat Partner(s).",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_2_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_3_1 = {
          ContentEN = "During <H>world exploration</>, if a Combat Partner falls, they can be <H>resummoned</> by the corresponding Sigil.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_3_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_3_2 = {
          ContentEN = "During <H>Commissions</>, if a Combat Partner falls, approach them and <H>hold</> &Interactive& to <H>rescue</> them.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_3_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_3_2_Phone = {
          ContentEN = "During <H>Commissions</>, if a Combat Partner falls, approach them and <H>hold</> the interactive button to <H>rescue</> them.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_3_2_Phone"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_3_3 = {
          ContentEN = "In <H>Nocturnal Echoes</> stages, fallen Combat Partners <H>cannot be resummoned</> or <H>rescued</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_3_3"
        },
        UIGuide_Phantom_4_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Combat Partners consume both Sanity and Ammo in battle. Approaching ammunition dropped by enemies can replenish their Ammo. ",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Phantom_4_1"
        },
        UIGuide_PinTu_1 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Some platforms display fragments of an image.
When pieced together correctly, the surrounding scene will change to match the completed image.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_PinTu_1"
        },
        UIGuide_QiTianDeng_1 = {
          ContentEN = "<H>Sky Lanterns</> float above the Waters of Forgetting. Shattering one with a ranged weapon causes its Lantern Blossoms to fall and form a constantly shrinking safe zone on the water's surface, helping you withstand the Rift's erosion. You may move within this zone and steadily recover HP.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QiTianDeng_1"
        },
        UIGuide_QianKun_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Use the <H>Mechanical Nexus</> to rotate the Dual-Shape Propeller and alter the structure of the Labyrinth of Yanyin.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QianKun_1"
        },
        UIGuide_QianKun_2 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Use the <H>Mechanical Nexus</> on the left side of the Dual-Shape Propeller to rotate the rooms in the Labyrinth of Yanyin clockwise. Using it from the opposite side rotates them counter-clockwise.
The direction of rotation depends on where you stand when activating the Dual-Shape Propeller.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QianKun_2"
        },
        UIGuide_QiaoBan_1 = {
          ContentEN = [[
The Mechanical Puzzle Board consists of pivots and platforms.
 Pivots can lock onto adjacent platforms.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QiaoBan_1"
        },
        UIGuide_QiaoBan_2 = {
          ContentEN = "After activating the Mechanical Puzzle Board, interact with the Enlightenment Stele again to reset it.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QiaoBan_2"
        },
        UIGuide_QueXie_1 = {
          ContentEN = "You can equip and summon <H>Mechanical Nexus: The Bane</> from the Tactical Backpack.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QueXie_1"
        },
        UIGuide_QueXie_2_PC = {
          ContentEN = "After summoning Mechanical Nexus: The Bane, press &Fire& to fire a laser and interact with certain mechanisms.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QueXie_2_PC"
        },
        UIGuide_QueXie_2_Phone = {
          ContentEN = "After summoning Mechanical Nexus: The Bane, press the button to fire a laser and interact with certain mechanisms.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_QueXie_2_Phone"
        },
        UIGuide_Reading = {
          ContentEN = "You can find readable items such as books, notes, and letters scattered around the world.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Reading"
        },
        UIGuide_RelayMechanism_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Attacking a <H>Phoxynamo Wheel</> will toggle its activation status. If the <H>Phoxynamo Wheel</> is <H>blue</>, it is <H>active</>. If it appears <H>orange</>, it is <H>inactive</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_RelayMechanism_1"
        },
        UIGuide_RelayMechanism_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Some <H>Phoxynamo Wheels</> will <H>automatically revert</> to their <H>original state</> after a set time following a status change.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_RelayMechanism_2"
        },
        UIGuide_RongQi_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Containers within the arena hold relics of varying value. Once opened, their contents are automatically appraised. You may then choose to stash some of the higher-value items in your Treasure Pouch.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_RongQi_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Rouge_1 = {
          ContentEN = "The space within the Abyssum is unstable and constantly shifting. After clearing each stage, new gates will appear, each leading to a different type of zone. Choose your path and continue your exploration.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Rouge_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Rouge_2_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Abyssoid Zone: Combat-focused. Defeat the Abyssoids to earn rewards such as Embers.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Rouge_2_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Rouge_2_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Echo Zone: Contains unpredictable events known as Encounters.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Rouge_2_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Rouge_2_3 = {
          ContentEN = "R&R Zone: A safe zone where you can trade Embers for supplies, restore HP, and recover Sanity.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Rouge_2_3"
        },
        UIGuide_Run_PC = {
          ContentEN = "Hold &Avoid& to sprint.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Run_PC"
        },
        UIGuide_Run_Phone = {
          ContentEN = "Hold the button to sprint.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Run_Phone"
        },
        UIGuide_SIDEWAYSJUMP = {
          ContentEN = "When near a climbable wall, hold a direction and press &Jump& <H>repeatedly</> to leap sideways and perform consecutive wall jumps.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SIDEWAYSJUMP"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Press &Skill1& for Psyche to create 1 [Phantasm] and then flashes forward. This skill can be used at any time without interrupting Psyche's current action.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_1_Gamepad = {
          ContentEN = "Press &GamepadUseSkill& + &Attack& for Psyche to create 1 [Phantasm] and then flashes forward. This skill can be used at any time without interrupting Psyche's current action.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_1_Gamepad"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_1_Phone = {
          ContentEN = "Press the button for Psyche to create 1 [Phantasm] and then flashes forward. This skill can be used at any time without interrupting Psyche's current action.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_1_Phone"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Press &Skill2& for Psyche to enter [Flamboyance] state and gain the ability to fly. When in [Flamboyance] state, Psyche can only use skills and shoot. In [Flamboyance] state, [Chrysalis Dreamweave] is replaced with [Phototaxis]: Dashes forward and fires [Ethereal Powder] that auto-locks onto a random enemy, dealing Anemo Damage on hit.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_2_Gamepad = {
          ContentEN = "Press &GamepadUseSkill& + &Interactive& for Psyche to enter [Flamboyance] state and gain the ability to fly. When in [Flamboyance] state, Psyche can only use skills and shoot. In [Flamboyance] state, [Chrysalis Dreamweave] is replaced with [Phototaxis]: Dashes forward and fires [Ethereal Powder] that auto-locks onto a random enemy, dealing Anemo Damage on hit.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_2_Gamepad"
        },
        UIGuide_Saiqi_2_Phone = {
          ContentEN = "Press the button for Psyche to enter [Flamboyance] state and gain the ability to fly. When in [Flamboyance] state, Psyche can only use skills and shoot. In [Flamboyance] state, [Chrysalis Dreamweave] is replaced with [Phototaxis]: Dashes forward and fires [Ethereal Powder] that auto-locks onto a random enemy, dealing Anemo Damage on hit.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Saiqi_2_Phone"
        },
        UIGuide_Shadow_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Use <H>Combat Partner Sigil</> to summon allies in battle. Drag Combat Partner Sigils into the Tactical Backpack to enable summoning.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Shadow_1"
        },
        UIGuide_Shadow_2 = {
          ContentEN = "Hold &OpenBattleWheel& to summon allies, who will fight alongside your current character.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Shadow_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ShanYe_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Use the Mechanical Nexus's pull mode to rotate the blades, generate wind, and open the gate.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShanYe_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ShenJi_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Use Mechanical Nexus: The Bane to mark a target point and command the Heavenwrought Cannon to fire.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShenJi_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ShenJi_2 = {
          ContentEN = "The Heavenwrought Cannon has a cooldown between shots. It deals massive damage to enemies.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShenJi_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ShengMing_1 = {
          ContentEN = "You can obtain <H>reputation</> through <H>Gauntlet</> and <H>Donation</>. Reputation has a weekly cap.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShengMing_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ShengMing_2 = {
          ContentEN = "After taking on and completing a Gauntlet, you will gain Reputation and unlock the next difficulty level.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShengMing_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ShengMing_3 = {
          ContentEN = "Gain Reputation by collecting and submitting required items for Donations. Donations refresh weekly automatically, or you can refresh them instantly by spending Coins.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShengMing_3"
        },
        UIGuide_ShouHu_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Special sealed containers appear in the arena and can only be opened by completing a Defence Task.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShouHu_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ShouHu_2 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Interact with one of the sealed containers to begin the task. The task lasts around one minute, during which waves of enemies will continue to appear and attack the containers. Defeat them before all the containers are destroyed, or the task will fail.
Before a container is fully destroyed, hold F to repair it. When the countdown ends, the task is successful as long as more than one container remains in the arena. Any containers successfully protected can then be opened.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ShouHu_2"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_01 = {
          ContentEN = "<Highlight>Ripples of Talk</> unlocked. Select the icon at Sanctuary to access them.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_01"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_01_Pad = {
          ContentEN = "<Highlight>Ripples of Talk</> is now unlocked. Press at the Sanctuary to access them",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_01_Pad"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_02 = {
          ContentEN = "<Highlight>Ripples of Talk</> capture fragments of time and memory.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_02"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_03 = {
          ContentEN = "Visit <Highlight>Sojourns of the Pages of Time</> to view stories from different stages of a character's life.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_03"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_03_Pad = {
          ContentEN = "Press to visit <Highlight>Sojourns of the Pages of Time</> and explore stories from different stages of a character's experience",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_03_Pad"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_04 = {
          ContentEN = "Each character has their own set of stories.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_04"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_04_Pad = {
          ContentEN = "Press to explore each character's unique storyline",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_04_Pad"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_05 = {
          ContentEN = "Use <Highlight>Soulprints</> to piece together these stories. Some entries have special prerequisites.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_05"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_06 = {
          ContentEN = "Meet the prerequisites to unlock stories and earn rewards.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_06"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_06_Pad = {
          ContentEN = "The stories will unlock once the prerequisites are met. Press to claim the associated rewards",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_06_Pad"
        },
        UIGuide_Sojourns_07 = {
          ContentEN = "Unlocked stories can be revisited at <Highlight>Seize the Sojourn</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sojourns_07"
        },
        UIGuide_Sp = {
          ContentEN = "The primary resource needed for using skills in battle. It <H>recovers</> over time.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_Sp"
        },
        UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Some objects can only be destroyed by <H>specific Bonus Effects</> or <H>specific Skill DMG</>.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_1"
        },
        UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_2 = {
          ContentEN = [[
For example, <H>Cryolite</> that covers some chests can be shattered with <H>Bonus Effect: Smash, Bonus Effect: Pyro, or skills that deal Pyro Damage</>.
(The character's and weapon's <H>attributes</> and the <H>probability</> of triggering Bonus Effects can be viewed in Armoury.)]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_2"
        },
        UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_3 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Some objects can only be destroyed by <H>specific Bonus Effects</> or <H>Combat Skills</> that deal specific damage.
<H>Umbro Vines</> that cover some chests can be shattered with <H>Bonus Effect: Slash, Bonus Effect: Lumino, or combat skills that deal Lumino Damage</>.
(The character's and weapon's <H>attributes</> and the <H>probability</> of triggering Bonus Effects can be viewed in Armoury.)]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_3"
        },
        UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_4 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Some objects can only be destroyed by <H>specific Bonus Effects</> or <H>Combat Skills</> that deal specific damage.
<H>Gravel</> that covers some chests can be shattered with <H>Bonus Effect: Smash</>.
(The character's and weapon's <H>attributes</> and the <H>probability</> of triggering Bonus Effects can be viewed in Armoury.)]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_4"
        },
        UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_5 = {
          ContentEN = [[
Some objects can only be destroyed by <H>specific Bonus Effects</> or <H>Combat Skills</> that deal specific damage.
<H>Lumino Shield</> that covers some chests can be shattered with <H>Bonus Effect: Spike, Bonus Effect: Umbro, or combat skills that deal Umbro Damage</>.
(The character's and weapon's <H>attributes</> and the <H>probability</> of triggering Bonus Effects can be viewed in Armoury.)]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_SpecialDestructible_5"
        },
