Once it is removed, you can damage them. Destroy both Justiciar Basalt Sentinels to lift the blockade.]],
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhenLv_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhengLi_1 = {
          ContentEN = "An item placed entirely within valid slots can be stored in the Inventory and will earn its base score.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhengLi_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhengLi_2 = {
          ContentEN = "If an item is placed entirely within special slots, its base score is doubled.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhengLi_2"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhengLi_3 = {
          ContentEN = "Items of the same type, except weapons, can be stacked. Each item in the stack contributes to the base score, up to the stack limit.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhengLi_3"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhengLi_4 = {
          ContentEN = "Ammo can be loaded directly into weapons. Each round loaded contributes to the base score, up to the weapon's ammo capacity.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhengLi_4"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhouYe_1 = {
          ContentEN = "In Huaxu, you can change the time of day from the <H>Time Cycle</> menu.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhouYe_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhuanZhou_1 = {
          ContentEN = "Shoot the pivot with Mechanical Nexus: The Bane to rotate it. If it is connected to adjacent platforms, they will rotate with it.",
          TextMapId = "UIGuide_ZhuanZhou_1"
        },
        UIGuide_ZhuanZhou_2 = {
          ContentEN = "If rotating the pivot would cause any connected platform to overlap another, the pivot will turn red and cannot be rotated.",
