        UI_Toast_Rouge_Detail = {
          ContentEN = [[
General Rules
1. You can use <Highlight>Glazeystal</> to repair the <Highlight>Lantern</> to ease the exploration.
2. Trace Points have no caps and can be exchanged for exploration rewards <Highlight>each week</>. The higher your <Highlight>Trial Rank</> is, the more Trace Points are required for more rewards.
3. <Highlight>Demon Wedge</> effects are disabled in Mystic Maze (Moves changed by Demon Wedges are still effective).
4. <Highlight>Combat Partners</> cannot be summoned in Mystic Maze.

About Zones
1. <Highlight>Abyssoid</> zones are battle zones, divided into four escalating difficulty tiers: Penumbral, Scattered, Atrocious, and Abysmal. Clearing an <Highlight>Abysmal Abyssoid</> zone completes the current exploration. All other Abyssoid zones reliably yield <Highlight>Embers</>.
2. The <Highlight>Abyssal Merchant</> allows you to trade <Highlight>Embers</>, and features <Highlight>Avian Spirits</> that restore your health.
3. <Highlight>Encounter</> is a special zone where a variety of events may occur.]],
          TextMapId = "UI_Toast_Rouge_Detail"
        },
